# 3. Functions I envision

Not implementations yet—just the API surface.

### Lifecycle

```text
resetCytState()
startCytMode()
stopCytMode()
```

### Epoch processing

```text
cytBeginEpoch()
cytFinalizeEpoch()
cytProcessObservation(...)
```

### RF environment

```text
cytAccumulateRfObservation(...)
cytBuildRfFeatures(...)
cytCompareRfFeatures(...)
cytUpdateEnvironmentState(...)
cytCommitNewEnvironment()
```

The important distinction is between:

**feature construction**

and

**segmentation decision**.

We should keep those separate so the segmentation algorithm can be tuned without redesigning data collection.

### Device fingerprinting

Prefer consuming normalized observations produced elsewhere:

```text
cytObserveWifiProbe(...)
cytObserveBleAdvertisement(...)
cytUpdateWifiFingerprint(...)
cytUpdateBleFingerprint(...)
```

But these should probably be thin CYT adapters rather than duplicate parsers.

### Persistence

```text
cytFindOrCreateDevice(...)
cytRecordDeviceObservation(...)
cytRecordEnvironmentObservation(...)
cytUpdatePersistenceScore(...)
cytHandleDeviceReappearance(...)
```

### UI

```text
drawCytDeviceList()
drawCytDeviceDetail()
drawCytEnvironmentHistory()
```

and the existing input architecture would dispatch CYT-specific selection/touch behavior rather than creating an entirely separate input subsystem.

